{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Linearama 是一款主打隨手記錄與整理靈感的筆記 App，適合需要快速捕捉想法、塗鴉或回憶，並希望筆記保持本地擁有權的用戶；現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-130.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>本地離線筆記整理</h2>\n<p>Linearama 讓用戶先把靈感、塗鴉或回憶快速記入收件匣，無需即時整理結構；之後可依標籤或內容把筆記分組成檢視，甚至將多個檢視組成整理器。筆記儲存在裝置本地，離線時仍可隨時存取，也可按需要透過 iCloud 在裝置之間同步，同時保留筆記的擁有權與控制權。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-370-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-371-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-372-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-373-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Linearama – Smart notes</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/linearama-smart-notes/id6745355956?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:00:43.898372+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":288,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T22:37:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T01:38:51.119967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T22:58:31.176407+00:00","content_hash":"e413146ad1b332280428f26ff8cb9981c2dc55d6aad6e7abdcae3f719a4f23eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}